# Cloudflare Pages (and Netlify) SPA fallback: the whole site is a single
# client-hydrated route (the game itself), so any path that isn't a literal
# static asset falls back to the index.html shell. Real static files (JS/CSS/
# WASM/images) are matched first regardless of this rule -- see
# svelte.config.js `fallback: 'index.html'`.
#
# NOTE: inert on Cloudflare Workers Static Assets (the current deploy
# target) -- Workers doesn't process _redirects, only Pages does.
# wrangler.jsonc's assets.not_found_handling: "single-page-application"
# does the equivalent for Workers.
/* /index.html 200
